### 1. Get All Tickets (Unfiltered)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. Filter by Status (OPEN)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN
Accept: application/json

###

### 3. Filter by Priority (HIGH)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=HIGH
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. Filter by Category (Email)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?category=Email
Accept: application/json

###

### 5. Paginated Tickets - Page 0 (First 5 Items)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 6. Paginated Tickets - Page 1 (Next 5 Items)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=1&size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### 7. Paginated & Sorted Tickets - Newest First
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=createdAt&direction=desc
Accept: application/json

### ====================================================================
### DAY 8 EXERCISE 5: EDGE CASES & TROUBLESHOOTING
### ====================================================================

### Test 1: Invalid Status Value
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=INVALID
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 2: Invalid Priority Value
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?priority=URGENT
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 3: Page Number with No Records
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=99&size=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 4: Very Large Page Size
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=100
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 5: Unknown Sort Field
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets/paged?page=0&size=5&sortBy=unknownField&direction=asc
Accept: application/json

###

### Test 6: Combined Filters (Overlapping Params)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tickets?status=OPEN&priority=HIGH
Accept: application/json